  "description": "Drop-in AutoMapper replacement — fastest .NET runtime object-to-object mapper. Same API (CreateMap, ForMember, Profile, IMapper), 2-5x faster. Zero runtime reflection, zero extra allocations, compiled expression trees. Supports DI, EF Core, Blazor, collections, flattening, nested types, and all AutoMapper features.",
